Found one thing while doing it. `getProperty()` is advertised on `PropertyInfoExtractorInterface` through `@method`, which keeps existing implementations valid, but `ObjectNormalizer` called it unconditionally on the extractor passed to its constructor. Any third-party `PropertyInfoExtractorInterface` written before this fatals:

